Third-party software
--------------------
The container image contains third-party software, each part under its own
licence:

- Python packages installed from the hashed lock file (requirements.txt),
- npm packages bundled into the web app (the non-development packages of
  frontend/package-lock.json),
- the Debian operating-system packages of the python:3.12-slim base image.

The image holds their licence texts and a statement on the Debian packages in
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES, next to this file. The SBOM of each image build
(sbom.spdx.json) lists every package with its version. docs/licences.md records
the licence of each direct runtime dependency, and licence-exceptions.toml the
reviewed exceptions to the licence allow-list. Some of these packages are under
the MPL-2.0 (for example certifi); they are included unmodified.
